    "title": "Lake Charles police corporal Dakota Baccigalopi recognized for heroic action - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joe Gallinaro ,\n9 hours ago A Lake Charles police corporal is recognized for his work in talking a potentially suicidal man down from the I-10 Calcasieu River Bridge. Deputy Chief Larry Moss says on August 13th, they got a call about a man sitting on a bridge truss beyond the safety railing – and that’s when Corporal Dakota Baccigalopi went into action. Read full article\n1",
